\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Day after day I sought the Lord,
\par And waited patiently;
\par Until He bent down from His throne,
\par And hearkened to my cry.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. He drew me from the fearful pit,
\par And from the miry clay;
\par He placed my feet upon a rock,
\par And led me in His way
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. He taught my soul a new-made song, 
\par A song of Holy praise;
\par All they who see these things, with fear
\par Their hopes to God shall raise.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Most blessed is the man whose hope
\par Upon the Lord relies;
\par Who follows not the proud, nor those
\par That turn aside to lies.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. O Lord, what wonders hast Thou wrought,
\par All number far above:
\par Thy thoughts to us-ward overflow
\par With mercy, grace, and love.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

